    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the bar, Max has done something clumsy that nearly broke his friend Kostya's nose. He tries to make it up to him, while Kostya, dizzy, asks for a glass of fresh orange juice. Meanwhile, the hunt for the chef's knife is still turning the kitchen upside down. Here it is in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Как-то неловко получилось, Костя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты чуть не сломал мне нос!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Старичок, прости меня, пожалуйста!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
